Quest 567 "[Regained Honor] Rumor"
    Journal for karus "You must talk to [Captain] Fargo at Luferson Castle."
    Journal for elmorad "You must talk to [Captain] Falkwine at El Morad Castle."

Requires player level >= 65 and quest 566 is completed

Rewards none

On available
    If player is karus
        Say "[Guard] Melburick check for a long time. Should go find it."
        Topic "All right, I'll swing by" goto close
    If player is elmorad
        Say "[Guard] Zalk This long time's check. Should go find it."
        Topic "All right, I'll swing by" goto close

On offer
    If player is karus
        Say "... Oh, you back. <selfname>!"
        Topic "Tell me more..." do
            Show quest "It is something else, but these days because of the strange rumors and anxious residents of the mainland. What does this rumor? One of the famous heroes are related to people the bag destroyed was updated Eslant\n\nThere's a rumor about annihilation. [Captain] Fargo is looking for you."
    If player is elmorad
        Say "... Oh, you back. <selfname>!"
        Topic "Tell me more..." do
            Show quest "It is something else, but these days because of the strange rumors and anxious residents of the mainland. What does this rumor? One of the famous heroes are related to people the bag destroyed was updated Eslant\n\nThere's a rumor about annihilation. [Captain] Falkwine is looking for you."

